      "lines": [
        "975. 三角形的一边长83.6厘米，第二边比第一边长14.8厘",
        "米，第三边比第二边长8.6厘米。求这个三角形的周长。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "59. 小数的减法"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "问题. 钳工学徒每月工资71.35卢布。定级以后每月工",
        "资114.8卢布。他的月工资增加了多少？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为了解这个题，需要从114.8中减去71.35："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$114.8-71.35=114.80-71.35=114\\frac{80}{100}-71\\frac{35}{100}↵=43\\frac{45}{100}=43.45$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "每个月的工资增加了43.45卢布。小数的减法也可以方",
        "便地写成“竖式”："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\phantom{-}114.80$",
        "$\\underline{-\\ \\phantom{1}71.35}$",
        "$\\phantom{-1}43.45$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "一小数减去另一小数，需要：1）使被减数和减数的小数",
        "点后面位数相等；2）把减数写在被减数下面并使它们的小数",
        "点对齐；3）和自然数的减法一样做减法；4）相减以后，在差的",
        "对着被减数和减数小数点的位置上点上小数点。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
